utputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d01.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D01","cfgdocs.io.output.d01.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D01 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d02.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D02","cfgdocs.io.output.d02.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D02 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d03.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D03","cfgdocs.io.output.d03.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D03 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d04.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D04","cfgdocs.io.output.d04.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D04 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d05.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D05","cfgdocs.io.output.d05.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D05 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D06","cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D06 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgdocs.io.output.d07.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D07","cfgdocs.io.output.d07.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D07 applies its initial state at startup or keeps the TCA9554 hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On cold power-on, outputs are still forced OFF.","cfgmods_meta.iomodule.enum_sets.io_output_boot_behavior.0.label":"Apply initial state","cfgmods_meta.iomodule.enum_sets.io_output_boot_behavior.1.label":"Retain on ESP32 reboot","cfgdocs.io.drivers.mcp23017.address.label":"MCP23017 address","cfgdocs.io.drivers.mcp23017.address.help":"I2C address of the MCP23017 used for the additional digital outputs.","cfgdocs.io.drivers.mcp23017.enabled.label":"MCP23017 enabled","cfgdocs.io.drivers.mcp23017.enabled.help":"Enable the MCP23017 driver for additional digital outputs.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.label":"Physical port D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.binding_port.help":"Identifier of the physical port driven by output D08. Use \"Not connected\" to leave this logical output unassigned.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.label":"Active high D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_active_high.help":"If true, D08 is active-high; otherwise it is active-low.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.label":"Initial ON state D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_initial_on.help":"State applied at startup for output D08.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.label":"Pulse mode D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_momentary.help":"Enable pulse behavior for D08.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.label":"Output name D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_name.help":"Readable name for digital output D08.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.label":"Pulse duration D08 (ms)","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.d08_pulse_ms.help":"Automatic pulse duration for D08.","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.label":"Boot behavior D08","cfgdocs.io.output.d08.retain_on_warm_reboot.help":"Choose whether D08 applies its initial state at startup or attempts to retain the hardware latch during an ESP32 warm reboot. On MCP23017 outputs, retention is ignored and the initial state is applied.","cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_port.label":"Physical port D09","cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_po